1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:03,474
Household costs keep rising, and I'm just sitting at home.

2
00:00:03,774 --> 00:00:08,244
Sunita, the whole street remembers your cooking. Start a tiffin service!

3
00:00:08,544 --> 00:00:10,119
But who will buy it, Chacha ji?

4
00:00:10,419 --> 00:00:17,273
Hostels, PGs and offices nearby. Start with ₹15,000 for tiffins and big pots.

5
00:00:17,573 --> 00:00:23,530
Make a WhatsApp group and post the daily menu. And get your FSSAI food registration.

6
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:27,927
Aunty, I'm sick of hostel food. Sign me up for a monthly tiffin!

7
00:00:28,227 --> 00:00:32,470
Dal, sabzi, four rotis and rice. ₹3,000 a month.

8
00:00:32,770 --> 00:00:42,552
Thirty customers means ₹90,000 a month. Even after costs, ₹35,000 to ₹40,000 stays with you.

9
00:00:42,852 --> 00:00:45,846
When customers grow, hire a delivery boy.

10
00:00:46,146 --> 00:00:48,570
A business from home! Sunita's life is set!
